// frob:doc docs/strata/threat.md#capabilities-drag-in-obligations
assume "weakness:CWE-89:vet" noflow registry -> vet owner logan review "2026-10-15"
// frob:doc docs/strata/threat.md#capabilities-drag-in-obligations
